---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Base title='obsessions'>
  <div class='profile-card reading' data-label='WHAT AM I READING?'>
    <div class='reading-content'>
      <p class='obsessions-text'>
        I'm currently obsessed with Shuukura (Story About Buying My Classmate
        Once A Week). I'm up to date with the light novel and I've been enjoying
        waiting for the new chapters. Questionable at times, but what draws me
        in is its psychological depth, the way the author explores human
        connection, love, codependency, and family trauma.
      </p>
      <img
        class='obsessions-img'
        src='https://avelilium.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/71ofy5y89wl._sl1500_-1.jpg?w=721'
        width='200px'
        alt=''
      />
    </div>

    <div class='card-footer'>
      <a
        href='https://avelilium.com/download-epubs/'
        target='_blank'
        rel='noopener'
      >
        where to read ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class='profile-card reading' data-label='WHAT AM I WATCHING?'>
    <div class='reading-content'>
      <p class='obsessions-text'>
        Goodbye, Lara is an original anime from this season. ANIMATION AND ART
        IS SO BEAUTIFUL. I don't know if it's really going to be a yuri story,
        but some scenes seems like foreshadowing to make Lara and Mari the main
        couple. It's a good story about love. I'm excited week by week ready to
        see the next episode. I hope it will be a good ending.
      </p>
      <img
        class='obsessions-img'
        src='https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx177637-8onaQWqKW1C3.jpg'
        width='200px'
        alt=''
      />
    </div>

    <div class='card-footer'>
      <a
        href='https://nyaa.si/?f=0&c=0_0&q=%5BToonsHub%5D+Goodbye+Lara'
        target='_blank'
        rel='noopener'
      >
        where to watch ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .reading-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .obsessions-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .obsessions-img {
    border: 1px solid var(--amber-dim);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .reading-content {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }
  }
</style>
